# No environment variables are required to fetch data, clean it, build
# features, train either ranker, evaluate, or export -- every step in this
# repo runs from the local Kaggle download and local files only.
#
# Kaggle CLI credentials (~/.kaggle/kaggle.json) are used by `fetch.py` to
# pull the dataset; they are read from the standard Kaggle CLI location,
# not from this file, and are never committed.
